      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Cogumelo. Paras escava sob a terra para roer raízes de árvores. Os cogumelos em suas costas absorvem a maior parte dos nutrientes.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/4 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Inseto, Grama &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Paras pode evoluir para Parasect no nível 8 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Scratch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Poison Powder, Stun Spore</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Absorb</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Fury Cutter</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Spore</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Slash</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Growth</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Giga Drain</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Aromatherapy, Rage Powder</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>X-Scissor</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Aerial Ace, After You, Attract, Brick Break, Bug Bite, Confide, Double Team, Energy Ball, Facade, False Swipe, Frustration, Giga Drain, Grass Knot, Hidden Power, Knock Off, Leech Life, Light Screen, Nature Power, Protect, Rest, Return, Rock Smash, Round, Seed Bomb, Sleep Talk, Sludge Bomb, Snore, Solar Beam, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swords Dance, Synthesis, Thief, Toxic, Venoshock, Worry Seed, X-Scissor</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Agility, Bug Bite, Counter, Cross Poison, Endure, Fell Stinger, Flail, Grassy Terrain, Leech Seed, Metal Claw, Natural Gift, Psybeam, Pursuit, Rototiller, Screech, Sweet Scent, Wide Guard</p>",
